# Kit-maintenance files: they exist in the maintainer's working copy and must
# never reach the npm tarball. package.json's "files" allowlist includes all of
# .agent/, and npm packs the working tree (not git), so gitignored notes would
# otherwise ship. npm honors a .npmignore in a subdirectory of "files".
# Keep in sync with KIT_ONLY_* in bin/devbureau.js.

# Session state written by the Claude Code hooks
.tmp/

# Maintainer notes (see the "Kept locally only" block in the root .gitignore)
memory/benchmark-log.md
memory/pattern-mining-log.md
memory/retro-log.md
memory/behavioral-alignment-wave2.md
memory/frontend-design-knowledge-extraction.md
memory/archive/
skills/framework-benchmarking/references/sources.md
